Technical Summary

This update proves that system intelligence can scale exponentially through clean, modular architecture rather than raw mass. By coupling automated local deployment scripts with immutable audit ledgers and read-only semantic bounds, J.A.I.S.S maintains enterprise-grade control, absolute zero-drift posture, and complete historical continuity directly on local hardware. 

